  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "those seconds would feel awful.",
    "sys_consistent_procedure": "My habit is to ask one question, the same one",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "I can't figure out the workers at all",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "A supervisor requiring a brake check before track work would have spared everyone this."
